{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>So Moses commanded.</b> He commanded that they not give to these the land of Sihon and Og until after they return from the conquest of the land, as it says: וְנִכְבְּשָׁה הָאָרֶץ וְאַחַר תָּשֻׁבוּ וְהָיְתָה הָאָרֶץ הַזֹּאת לָכֶם (Numbers 32:22), and not before. But they did not accept this, and said: נַחְנוּ נַעֲבֹר חֲלוּצִים (Numbers 32:32), וְאִתָּנוּ אֲחֻזַּת נַחֲלָתֵנוּ — that it be in our possession at the time we cross the Jordan."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:38.298924589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}